  <item>
    <title>Ep13. 车祸/罚款/比手画脚/装聋作哑...出门旅个游，我容易嘛我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673d6ae88d1233fb0d964331</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673d6ae88d1233fb0d964331</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Nov 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>📝前言</span></h2><p><span>这期和好朋友歪歪一起聊旅行！出门在外，哪有什么岁月静好，都是人在囧途罢了，但有惊无险就是旅游最大的魅力！！</span></p><h2><span>🎙️山路遇车祸，村民暗中提醒我，赔太多了啦 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️连骂2天，意大利你还我80欧！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️维也纳仙女帮我逃过一劫，布达佩斯罚款虽迟但到，惟有苏格兰人民最最好❤️ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️我真的很需要吹风筒，意大利大叔你别走 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️yeah yeah yeah，每次点餐都是一场豪赌 （不是..咖啡店语速放慢判几年💦） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️在外犯错很正常，别再苛求大家都是完美旅客了 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️向老外学习，call the police！ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a></span></h2><h2><span>🎙️小锅人生第一尴尬大事...尴尬到想跳车，想连夜买机票潜逃回国 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a> &nbsp;</span></h2><h2><span>🎙️人在异乡为异客，出去了才知道什么叫“故乡” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a></span></h2><p><span>🎵bgm: Who You Share It With (by </span><a href="https://www.musicbed.com/artists/layup/43567" data-url="https://www.musicbed.com/artists/layup/43567"><span>Layup</span></a><span>)</span></p><p><span>本期主播：小锅与歪歪</span></p><p><span>小红书官方账号：@聊完拉倒播客</span></p><p><span>小红书日常号：@那口小锅</span></p><p><span>微信公众号：聊完拉倒&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
