  <item>
    <title>Ep9. 想睡个好觉而已，怎么就这么难呢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6718ea190d2f24f2894e4d5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6718ea190d2f24f2894e4d5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2024 12:20:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>📝前言</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>你睡得好吗？我们睡不好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为2个“失眠患者”，我们已崩溃过无数次，卤肉姐说「别无所求，什么都不重要，我只想睡得好」，小锅说「有一天突然就不会睡觉了，就好像忘记了怎么走路，太绝望了」</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过好在这世上还是存在一些有效的睡眠技巧，小锅也从最糟糕的失眠状态里恢复了过来，一切还是有希望的，祝大家都能睡个好觉。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 🎙️视力和睡眠，总得保一个吧</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>假装自己没失眠，就能睡着吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>喝酒真的有助于睡眠吗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>Headspace Guide to Sleep&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> </span></strong><strong><span>🎙️身体很“焦虑”，精神很抽离</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>睡不着是因为我不困吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>闭上眼就就开始想事情，可我也没觉得自己焦虑啊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>道家和塔罗都说，人的最高境界是「身心合一」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> </span><strong><span>🎙️为何睡眠会崩坏</span></strong><strong><span>，又为何会好起来</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>生活习惯截然不同的2个人，为什么都睡眠障碍了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>解决不了情绪问题，睡眠这道题是不是就无解了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> </span><strong><span>🎙️原来大家都睡不好，就没人来管管吗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> </span><strong><span>🎙️失眠要怪爱迪生吗</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>为什么说失眠的人要多晒太阳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>褪黑素，血清素与维生素D</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>常说「胃是情绪器官」，还真有点道理</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a> </span><strong><span>🎙️聊完太阳，再check一下交感神经与副交感神经</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>掐自己、拍打手臂、原地高抬腿，我不是疯子，我只是想安抚交感神经</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>睡前运动，还做hiit，这科学么</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>Headspace Guide to Sleep</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>30</span></strong><strong><span>:18 </span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>聊聊文献里的助眠技巧，中式养生角度的补充，以及我们的实操结果</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>1. 行为改变法，为自己设定一套固定的作息时间。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2. 放松技巧，如冥想、正念、轻音乐等。中式养生：五音入五脏。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>3. 体育锻炼，如拳击、有氧运动、普拉提等。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>4. 身心锻炼，带有修身养性成分的运动，如瑜伽、太极、气功、八段锦等。中式养身：遵循天地之气做，除了养阴的运动外，最好都在白天做哦。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>5. 芳香疗法和按摩，两者结合效果更佳。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>6. 物理环境改变法，光疗，降低房间噪音等其他睡眠干扰。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>7. 心理治疗。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>大家可以猜猜这7种方法里面哪种的研究结果最正面。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>References</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Albakri, U., Drotos, E., &amp; Meertens, R. (2021). Sleep health promotion interventions and their effectiveness: an umbrella review. </span><em><span>International journal of environmental research and public health</span></em><span>, </span><em><span>18</span></em><span>(11), 5533.</span></p><span></span><p><span>De Niet, G., Tiemens, B., Lendemeijer, B., &amp; Hutschemaekers, G. (2009). Music‐assisted relaxation to improve sleep quality: meta‐analysis. </span><em><span>Journal of advanced nursing</span></em><span>, </span><em><span>65</span></em><span>(7), 1356-1364.</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>8. 针灸。卤肉姐亲身经历，对改善睡眠很有帮助。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2834">47:14</a> </span><strong><span>🎙️都说打麻醉是睡得最好的一次，是吗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2984">49:44</a> </span><strong><span>🎙️病急乱投医，但请谨遵医嘱！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️2位主播非专业人士，只是从自助的角度阅读了相关文献与讯息，仅供参考，如有错误，欢迎评论区纠正与指教～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm: How Beautiful (by </span><a href="https://www.musicbed.com/artists/austin-farwell/44978" data-url="https://www.musicbed.com/artists/austin-farwell/44978"><span>Austin Farwell</span></a><span>)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小锅与卤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书官方账号：@聊完拉倒播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书日常号：@那口小锅</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：聊完拉倒</span></p>]]></description>
