  <item>
    <title>Ep7. 新疆之旅趣事锦集，很好，下次还去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6707848581cdab3a9303b2b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6707848581cdab3a9303b2b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Oct 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>📝前言</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>我们刚刚结束为期8天的新疆之旅，十分快乐！邀请大家一起来回味旅途，快乐60分钟～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️我们与司陪的爱恨情仇 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>路上狂飙、插队、走捷径的是他，叠衣服、收行李、守男德的也是他</span></p><span></span><p><span>野蛮匪气的男妈妈，好一个小马哥</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>每次下车后，小马哥都帮我们把衣服叠得整整齐齐的，放到每个人包里：</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmqQaktoIMQfExsxW25t1cVOdMw0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️新疆的人儿可爱又迷人 </span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>卤肉缺心眼儿冒犯人，小锅汗流浃背疯狂找补</span></p><span></span><p><span>与“和田二街卖抓饭的大叔、开didi的小哥、金泉商场卖帽子的阿姨、好脾气的帅哥摊主、卖驼裤的大叔、玲玲米粉店的小姐姐、禾木村卖烤红薯的小哥、白哈巴爱马的小哥...”的趣事、暖心小事</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>爱马小哥在玩小灰灰的嘴唇子：</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkc8y6m633bDyNjuDBewCg9445di.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>还有一个牧场主小叶忘记说了！心地善良的2米大汉子，我们问他游客的车不会破坏他的牧场给他造成困扰吗？他说：会啊，但我心太软了，不忍心赶大家走。铁汉柔情！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>小叶与钟姐、赵姐合影：</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlzYwM8BBtNyfr-kysQHzrDkNCRp.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️新疆最美在意外 </span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>头晕想吐的夜路，抬头发现银河苍穹</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>赵姐记录的星空：</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmtbX5ZUmfcUsW32_qasRxetCLtF.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小路上的无人树林，一脚踩进大自然里</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>小锅疯狂抱树：</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liq9vc43sgFS1g8UOhslsp8nIfsL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>县里的白桦林公园，在秋天里荡秋千</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>卤肉（戴着小锅在金泉商场阿姨那买的帽子）在荡飞天秋千：</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lveK2W7iZzWI0XTbmASWnhzOymOf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️旅行好物/坏物分享 </span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2993">49:53</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>唯一坏物：</span></strong><span>立刻马上！丢掉！卤肉姐的，铁皮漏水水壶！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>好物：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>晕交通工具的人请带：头戴式降噪耳机</span></p><span></span><p><span>不喜欢累赘行李的人请带：充气式U型枕、优衣库HEATTECH内衣</span></p><span></span><p><span>脚冷爱流汗的人请带：真正的羊毛袜</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️夸夸我们的超好团友 54</span></strong><span>:06</span></p><span></span><p><span>赵姐：高级脸长条人，大片神图生产者，偷偷做了不少好事的暖心i人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小钟：性格敞亮的可爱甜妹，超绝镜头表现力，世界是钟姐的玩物</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📣下期预告：两眼一睁就是维权，我们的维权故事，全是感情？no！还有技巧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm：Goodbye (by </span><a href="https://www.musicbed.com/artists/sunshine-recorder/43864" data-url="https://www.musicbed.com/artists/sunshine-recorder/43864"><span>Sunshine Recorder</span></a><span>)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小锅与卤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书官方账号：@聊完拉倒播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书日常号：@那口小锅</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：聊完拉倒</span></p>]]></description>
